Three Key Business Insights

1. Top-Performing Categories: Identify which product categories generate the highest revenue to prioritize inventory and marketing efforts.


2. Best-Selling Products and Brands: Determine the top-performing products and brands by revenue to focus on popular items and improve sales strategies.


3. City-Wise Sales Performance: Compare revenue across cities to identify high-performing locations and cities with growth potential, helping businesses plan targeted promotions.



Note: These are insights the dashboard can reveal. The actual top categories, brands, and cities should be confirmed from your dashboard results.
